  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Intransitive (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧). Takes ⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧ particle: ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{凍|こご}える.\n\nCONJUGATION: Ichidan verb: {凍|こご}えない, {凍|こご}えます, {凍|こご}えて, {凍|こご}えれば.\n\nASPECT: {凍|こご}えて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates the resulting state of being frozen/numb.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧/⟦{足|あし}→足：00575_ashi⟧/⟦{指|ゆび}→指：01518_yubi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{凍|こご}える (hands/feet/fingers freeze)\n- {凍|こご}えそう (about to freeze)\n- {凍|こご}えるような⟦{寒|さむ}さ→寒さ：12336_samusa⟧/⟦{風|かぜ}→風：00641_kaze⟧ (freezing cold/wind)\n- {凍|こご}え{死|じ}ぬ (to freeze to death)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{凍|こお}る→凍る：02100_kooru⟧ (to freeze - for objects/water becoming ice)\n- かじかむ (to be numb with cold - more casual)\n- ⟦{冷|ひ}える→冷える：01154_hieru⟧ (to become cold - milder than {凍|こご}える)",
